WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
SimToReal Agent tests robot plans before an operator approves an export.
Our team is Visionary Creators.

00:07.000 --> 00:17.000
AMD Token Factory generated eight candidate plans for each task.
MuJoCo tested those plans locally, with a simulated Panda arm.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
In the red placement task, six candidates passed.
Two dropped a part.

00:22.000 --> 00:29.000
The system rejected those failures before ranking the remaining plans.

00:29.000 --> 00:36.000
Sorting both parts also produced six passing candidates
and two dropped parts.

00:36.000 --> 00:43.000
For the unreachable blue part, all eight candidates failed.
The application selected no best plan.

00:43.000 --> 00:52.000
Geometry checks and camera responses disagreed on the successful tasks,
so the application required human review.

00:52.000 --> 00:56.000
Across three recorded live runs, 24 plans were tested.
Twelve passed simulation and twelve failed.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
This prototype exports files.
It does not command a physical robot.
